OL,3,ABBC needs funding reform, but
OL,4,Acorporation should not overspend on
OL,5,Ainternationl hits, MPs say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe BBC should not pay "over the odds"
OL,8,Ffor the rights to overseas hits such as
OL,9,FSuits and Schitt's Creek, an
OL,10,Finfluential group of MPs has said.
OL,12,FIt is one of several issues raised in a
OL,13,Fwide-ranging report about the BBC's
OL,14,Ffunding and future, published by the
OL,15,FHouse of Commons' cross-party culture
OL,16,Fand media committee.
OL,18,FAlthough the BBC produces a lot of its
OL,19,Fown programmes, the corporation buys
OL,20,Fsome international shows for its TV
OL,21,Fchannels and iPlayer streaming
OL,22,Fplatform.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
