OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABBC needs funding reform, but
OL,4,Acorporation should not overspend on
OL,5,Ainternationl hits, MPs say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe MPs' report said the BBC could
OL,8,F"spend more wisely when competing for
OL,9,Fprogramming". Overall, the BBC brings
OL,10,F"immeasurable benefits" to society but
OL,11,Fneeds reform of the TV licence fee to
OL,12,Favoid a fate of "managed decline", they
OL,13,Fsaid.
